        "language": "english",
        "review": "A fun short twist on the bullet hell genre. The mechanic where you choose what obstacles you have to dodge is a very interesting dynamic to the game that creates a lot of tactics where you try to figure out which enemies are easier for you to dodge over others. This feels like a game you would find at an old-school arcade, but the roguelike elements flesh it out to keep it fresh, however I wish that there were more in-level upgrades to have more variety in strategy. The art style of this game is fantastic; some of the enemies and obstacles look hand-drawn, and that adds significantly to the flavor of the game.",
